  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/floxWHVXiNdO4AErjtgnPFWKAKoJ8BarbUeJWxACsV7h2kUMo6TOzfZuRQsCevvwRH9WhgnJ0TpDae9oCocu1Xcz6wdZfhRXuuGYuEevzbgtiVa9gyeIsddumrxdbpCkwGAChxCRpxk4ayamrs33vmGXYnIfpthWZCOZmCewIfJc72Au5THqLwAYDymAFVDgHsjsuWvc\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/18/b07ea615a604b965f1221aa32da0b8d0..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">さむすぎ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">はーー</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">雨だったし、さらにやばかった</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">12月前半でこの寒さなら</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">この先、もうどうなっちゃうの？？</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">つらい ふゆほんとにむり</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">( T . T )</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">寒すぎると筋肉おかしくなりませんか？</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なんか足とか手とか伸びなくなってびびった</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">夏生まれなので、夏が好きです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ずっと夏がいい 楽しいイベントいっぱいあるし</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">年中夏でいいじゃん</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんとにさむい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">手がやばい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">きょうは魔法学校一限遅刻したんですけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">雨降ってるからみんな遅刻するだろって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">思ったのか、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">授業開始から30分くらい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">サッカーの話してくれてたみたいで</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">出欠確認に間に合ったの！超嬉し～</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">先生愛してるよ、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">そして、きょうはアキバでクレープ食べたあ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">獲物を捕獲したかのような持ち方</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/CZkxbhSXBM4NRHdV9poS0mQusFmU7b6mhm02B0pyPu9Dv6g96AQBy5gWXqFPl3jrkOsNwg5YOFafxt4mWIlXkLoajaiGIB4fjcNaS3d47BMLqOkYOlooUrLfZmeklpC6CgEX1Y4ZzYO9RNMkqzCRwX0XqQOOxUzJWkwUinBZ97lXZS9jThgmDKWRBPiw7NE7r76Ldiuk\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/18/db8d780a543def1a427c465ea873b3ae..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<div align=\"center\">ネコ見ながら食べた！</div>\n<div align=\"start\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">みんなもネコ見ながら食べてみて‼️🤩</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/hlAY4U5UwYKNO7TuydZB6cCdZw13xl09yGkZCUfRAnTgUafMmt6MZTAypF64t0XYRZqSRqbyVruXGjhZ1oHjr2lBW7K1P7wP5DotCTViaY2nUhyN91BMFbyvSL7W6O6uX4Bv6YVKQUlZbEowAnhW430G6vhQjjG7NaAmtKFWYLLVKVRxeyGzliFjDEMF5V5NnsMQWr0B\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/18/0dc1038f231d98e9cda5bbd9f48ab460..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんとに急に寒いから</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">みなさん体調には気をつけてください！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私も気をつけます( T . T )</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">うーさむ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ではでは</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
